# F6.4: a screen of 18 previews (24 KiB each) where 10 may be held (OFX_TEST_THUMB_HELD_MAX): the
# ones on screen are all kept, over the limit, and nothing is read again: dropping one drawn in the
# last frame would ask for it again at once, and again, a read every frame.
settle
key ctrl-2
wait-for 10000 thumbbusy=0 previews=18
wait 30
expect thumbbusy=0 previews=18 thumbheld=442368
quit
